      <activity id="57416f02-a58b-5726-a003-41f7c422eed1" activityNameId="5bf24e6b-8fad-59aa-b9ac-668c04f3ac18" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wheat seed IP, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wheat seed IP, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of wheat seed (fresh weight), with a maximum water content of 15%;
UUID: 14beef6b-8ce0-3f3f-b8c0-b7943d0799d3
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Consumption of wheat seed in Switzerland 17955 t/year, 0% imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_14beef6b-8ce0-3f3f-b8c0-b7943d0799d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
